WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:56.370
A nice bath after all.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:02.040
A quiet bath like this washes away the whole day's fatigue.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:03.960
Lord Reiha!

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:09.410
What, Iishe?  What's wrong?  Are we under attack?

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.350
It's not that.  There's something I need to show you.

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:13.910
Ah, something you need to show me?

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.340
Please just come with me.

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:18.450
Wait, I'm naked...!

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:20.010
Don't worry about it.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.820
The steam is covering all your naughty parts.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.150
Please hurry up!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.960
What about after it dissipates, Iishe?

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.650
Gee, enough is enough!

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:36.200
What's so damn urgent, that's worth interrupting my relaxing bath?

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:42.160
We found this while airing out some stuff in the warehouse.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.350
What's that?

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:48.080
A dirty map, that's full of worm holes.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:52.220
That's true, but please take a look at this.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.530
Let me see.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:59.270
"The locations marked on this map shows the treasures saved over the course of our entire lives."

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:01.650
Treasures...

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.770
Ah, this means...

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.450
That's right.  It's a treasure map.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.050
If we dig these up, we'll sure find lots of gold, silver and other treasures.

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:13.730
Because of your wasteful ways, the treasury is shrinking. This will solve our problem!

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.710
Who did you say wastes money?

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.730
Ah, ah, that's...

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:24.220
You know what they say, 
the more money you have, the happier you are!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:24.970
That's right.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:26.990
You're right.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.710
It's true that money does bring happiness.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.160
That means...

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:37.510
Yeah.  Be ready tomorrow morning. We're going to hunt for treasure!

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:42.650
<b>Enshou Finds a Treasure</b>

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:54.680
Is it appropriate for just the three of us to take a leisurely trip to a hot spring?

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:59.730
Shunran, I'm glad you're so dedicated to your job, but you need a break once in a while.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:03.340
Yeah.  Work hard, play hard.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:08.220
One must be flexible in dealing with everything, just like commanding an army.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.430
That's how it should be.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:14.200
Aw, I can't wait to get to the hot spring!

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.350
Only connoisseurs know about this place.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:22.300
I've heard spring water is really good for your skin.  So, I'm planning a long soak to let my skin become silky smooth.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:26.340
After that...  Lord Karin and I...

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:34.860
Shunran, don't be such a sour puss.  I won't leave you out.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:37.630
That's not really what I meant...

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.980
Putting that aside...

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:46.530
It wasn't very nice to leave Shuuran behind to take care of the place all by herself.

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:53.470
Yeah, but I couldn't let all my commanders take a vacation at the same time, now can I?

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:56.500
I had to leave someone behind just in case of an emergency.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.770
You're right, but...

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:03.770
I hope Shuuran isn't sulking.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:07.480
<i>My, this hot spring feels great.</i>

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:10.770
<i>Yeah, it's so relaxing.</i>

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.370
<i>I'm really glad we came.</i>

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:17.930
<i>Um, what's wrong, Shuuran?
Why are you there all by yourself?</i>

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.390
<i>You should come and join us.</i>

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:20.920
<i>Yes, I will right away.</i>

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:36.790
Let's get to work.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.020
Sniff, sniff.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:46.250
Um, what's wrong, Rin Rin?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.520
Something stinks around here.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.400
It's not me.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:57.080
I think my stomach is a little full because I snacked on a sweet potato.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.870
but it's definitely not me!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.530
That means...

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:04.610
It's not me either.  Absolutely not.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:09.150
You guys are mistaken.  This is the smell of sulfur.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.420
Sulfur?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:12.050
Does that mean...

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:15.140
Yes.  There must be a hot spring nearby.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.150
I'm going in first!

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.710
Hey, don't rush ahead.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:28.960
What are you talking about?  Rushing is the fundamental  to battlefield tactics.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.010
But this is a hot spring!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.950
It hurts...!!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.400
What happened?

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.860
There's no water.

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:40.990
What's going on?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:43.020
This is useless.

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:44.480
We're going to catch a cold.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:46.680
You're right.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:49.330
Oh, my.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.540
Ah, you are...

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:53.550
Why are you here?

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:57.260
Why?  Isn't it obvious, we're here for the hot spring?

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.020
Ah, I see.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.010
By the way, Kan'u.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.810
Your bottom is moist and slick as usual.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.110
Slick?

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:15.850
Why is there a hot spring without any water?

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:17.390
It can't be helped.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.410
According to the locals...

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:25.780
The water has only flowed sporadically since a huge earthquake hit about two weeks ago.

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:28.100
Thanks to that, I have a bruised butt!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.180
My butt is all red, too!

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:34.630
But now our recreational trip is ruined.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:40.880
What a pity.  It's been a while since I unwound and relaxed in a hot spring.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.100
I wanted to get in a huge bath.

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:49.890
Um, everyone.  How about looking for a new hot spring?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.350
Looking for a new hot spring?

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:57.060
Do you mean looking where hot water flows and dig there?

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:58.160
Yes.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:03.450
Of course, there's no guarantee that we'll find one, but I think it's worth a try.

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:06.460
Keifa, what do you think?

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.740
I think it's possible, too.

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:13.400
All right!  Let's set out right away to look for a new hot spring!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:14.380
Wait a minute!

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.600
What's the matter?

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:20.250
Since we're all looking, let's have a competition...

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:24.300
You against us, to see which side digs the hot spring first!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.690
Competition?

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.670
Hm, that sounds interesting.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.310
Let me warn you, this isn't just for fun.

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:35.100
If we win this competition...

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:39.570
You guys will become my servants.

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:41.740
What did you say, you little brat?

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:42.750
Shunran.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.030
Son Shoukou...

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:49.260
We will oblige if we lose.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:49.780
Lord Karin!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.570
But, if we win...

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:57.240
Kan'u will be mine, agreed?

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.460
Agreed.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:01.840
Hey, don't make any decisions for me!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:02.730
All right!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.160
Since it's decided, let's charge ahead!

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:05.680
Okay.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:10.280
Hey, w...wait, you can't just...

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:21.930
Lord Karin, is it wise to make that kind of an agreement?

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:24.820
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:30.200
In order to obtain a brave warrior like Kan'u, a little risk is unavoidable.

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:36.220
But no matter how you put it, if we lose, we have to become servants to a total stranger.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.110
Then, we just have to win.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:40.810
That's true, but...

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:44.660
What's the matter?  You're not confident we can beat them?

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.120
No, that's not it.

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:51.580
Or perhaps you're... jealous?

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.560
Wh... what are you saying?

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.460
You don't have to worry.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:10:01.430
Even if Kan'u becomes my subordinate, I'll love you the same as I did before.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:06.700
You should already know my bed is big enough for all you guys.

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:10.690
Lord Karin, I...  um...

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:14.880
You are so adorable, Shunran.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:21.140
By the way, Keifa.  We've been walking for a while .

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.120
Can you really find a hot spring with that gadget?

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:28.480
Of course.  This method conforms to the best thinking of pseudoscience.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:33.590
It's extremely precise.  It can detect a drainpipe buried in the earth, let alone a hot spring.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:43.070
Toshi, I feel like we've been walking around in a circle for some time now.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:45.590
You're not going to tell me that we're lost, are you?

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.230
I don't think we're lost.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:52.240
This map has holes everywhere.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:56.260
I just can't quite figure out how to get to the marked locations.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:59.580
Hey!  Does that mean we're not going to find treasure?

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:05.080
I'm sure it's around here, somewhere...  I think.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.550
Lord Reiha, look at that!

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:10.510
You found it!?

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.350
Wh... what!?

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:16.730
Why is that insolent little girl here?

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:18.180
Ah, could they be...

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.130
looking for the treasure, too?

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:26.510
Damn her for getting in my way again.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:31.970
Lord Reiha, Kakouton is the only one among them who is skilled.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:35.930
Why not wait for a chance to take them out?

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:39.880
Wait, Iishe.  We have Lord Reiha with us!

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:40.960
Ah, you're right.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.890
Wait a second!

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:46.450
You make me sound like, I'm a burden.

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:50.450
Not "sound like", frankly, you ARE one...

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:51.630
What did you say!!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:56.410
Lord Reiha, please calm down.  Let's wait a bit longer and see how things turn out.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:59.180
And then what?

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:05.960
We follow Sōsō's party, and when they find the treasure, we'll steal it from them!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.360
I see.  That's a good idea.

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:11.070
As expected from someone with the power of intelligence, 32 points.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.060
It's 34!

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.780
Ah, it found it.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:34.360
Huh?

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:36.130
I'm sure it's here.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.480
So there's a hot spring under this rock.

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:40.640
I'll move the rock right away.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.180
Ah, wait a second.

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:47.480
I'm thirsty.  Let's do this after we get a drink from the creek we passed earlier.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.470
Do you have to do that now...?

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:51.000
I'm going, too.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.360
Well, me too, then...

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.520
It's seemed like they found it.

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:59.180
But, those guys left.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:02.100
I wonder where they're all going?

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:06.640
Maybe to the bathroom?  We always go together.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.710
Anyway, let's get the treasure now.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:10.720
Right.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:13.930
The treasure is under this.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:15.350
If we move it...

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.400
One, two, three!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:30.610
What's wrong, Koumei?

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:33.800
Umm, I thought I heard something...

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:39.230
Hey, no sign of a hot spring yet?  I'm bored.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:42.180
Then how about you helping out a bit?

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:46.690
No way!  I'm a princess, sweaty work is beneath me!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.740
By the way, Koumei.

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:54.180
Before we set out, you asked the villagers different questions and wrote something on the map.

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.430
What was that all about?

00:13:55.740 --> 00:14:00.750
Hot springs are mostly found where veins of water and earth intersect.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:05.000
Strange phenomena always happens at places like that.

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:09.780
For example, strange clouds hover in the sky throughout the day.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.660
Or a strange pillar of light reaches to the sky...

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:18.850
So I asked the villagers if they knew of such phenomena and marked the spots on the map.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:23.300
So this is one of those spots, huh?

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.350
Yes.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.090
Ah, a rabbit!

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.810
Hey!  It's dangerous to run off by yourself.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:41.750
Hey, wait, wait!  Wait, I said!  Hey!

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:51.350
Tiger!  Tiger!!

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:51.930
It's a bear!

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:54.390
Wah!   That's Ran Ran!!

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.980
I'm right, it's Ran Ran!

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:03.990
Ran Ran, Ran Ran...

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:07.750
H...Hey, Rin Rin...  What is Ran Ran?

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.940
Ran Ran is the bear cub I raised a long time ago.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:17.540
We lived together ever since he was a cub!

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:21.800
But grandpa said he no longer was a cub.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.290
So, I had to let him return to the mountains.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:26.600
We were crying as we said our farewells.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:31.460
I didn't expect to see him again, specially here... What a touching reunion!

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:36.110
Are you sure that's the bear you raised back then?

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.680
Of course!

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:43.030
I'll prove it to you , Ran Ran has a tuft of white fur under his armpit...

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:49.820
or NOT...  It seems I mistook this bear for Ran Ran.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:03.600
Geez, what was all that nonsense about touching reunion?

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:05.530
He looked really like him, so I was sure that...

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:07.930
That's not the case at all!

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:13.010
We just took off, I have no idea where we are.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.930
Let's study the map and see.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.390
Geez, what was that about!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:23.210
It was definitely a trap.  A trap set by Jun'iku

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:28.040
That cat-eared tactician.  Next time I see her, I'll make her pay for this.

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:31.550
Let's feed her squid and onion till she's scared.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.800
Abalone livers would be good, too.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:38.730
And folding a tangerine peel in half under her nose will do the trick as well.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.550
Ah, Lord Reiha, Iishe, look at that!

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:53.760
It seems those people are also looking for the treasure here.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:58.670
Lord Reiha, from what I can see, their map doesn't have any holes.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:01.330
It might clearly show the location of the treasure.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:03.270
Let's get it!

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:04.080
Yeah!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.240
Wh... what are you doing!

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:11.680
Hey, shut up!!

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:15.210
Ah, you're the one with the power of intelligence, 24 points, from before!

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.800
It's 34!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.300
You're pretty hung up on that.

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:21.140
That kind of thing doesn't matter.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.380
Hand over your map to me!

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:27.330
Or something might happen to this little girl.

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.060
Whatever happens to her, it doesn't matter.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:36.960
Wait a second!  What do you mean, "what ever happens to her it doesn't matter"!!

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:42.680
Yeah.  If you say that, as hostage-takers, we won't have a leg to stand on.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.530
I'm the one without a leg to stand on!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:49.100
That's right, Rin Rin.  I understand how you feel, but they need some kind of a leverage.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:54.480
Yeah.  Whatever the circumstances may be, I don't think you should speak the truth so directly.

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:56.650
I say, you guys...?

